@tradition rec-talent-night
// W3 (rec writer; lead 18: fields from plans/rec-traditions-plan.html FINAL and the brief; RA owns the format).
// Talent night on the rec deck: every 4 weeks on a Sunday 19:30-21:30 from Day 14 (14, 42, 70...), the auditorium; Lucia
// Ferreira hosts, Maeve Volkov runs the lights; the sign-up sheet goes up in the foyer a week before (mail.rec.talent.
// signup). FOR RA: skip any date within a week of the yearly talent-night (day 152) (lead 18); move Day 14 to the next
// free evening if the career clashes (lead 17's call 7). Your act: meeting rec.talent.you. A gathering.
k: 497
title: Talent night
when: every 4 weeks sunday week 2
at: 19:30-21:30
min: 45
prio: 1
jitter: 20
where: 7 room Auditorium: rec:seat
hold: none
who: ferreira always, volkov-maeve always, musician 80%, juniors 45%, everyone 40%
anim: musician play, everyone talk
host: ferreira
from: ferreira
flag: rec.on

== mail
- Talent night tomorrow, {time} in the auditorium. Lucia Ferreira hosts and Maeve Volkov runs the lights. Songs, the piano, juggling, whatever you've got. The sign-up sheet's in the foyer.

== ask
- Talent night later! I'm singing. I've practised in the music room all week. Sorry, Deck 4.   #funny
- Coming to talent night? You don't have to do anything. Clapping counts.
- Have you signed up for talent night? Go on. Lucia will make you sound brilliant.

== here
- A big hand, everyone!
- Shh, this one's beautiful.   #warm
- Next, someone very brave indeed.   #funny
- Lights down, please, Maeve.

== thanks
- You find a seat as the house lights dim. Lucia steps into the stage light and grins. Every act gets a cheer.   #warm

== chatter
- Did you hear the duet at talent night? I had goosebumps.   #warm
- Someone juggled spanners at talent night. Calder watched every spanner.   #funny
- They were rehearsing in the music room upstairs all week. We heard every note.   #funny
- The sign-up sheet for talent night is in the foyer. Brave people only. And me.   #funny
